# Normalise to LF in the repository. The site is authored on Windows and built on Linux
# (Cloudflare Pages), and CRLF has already cost this project real time elsewhere — a CRLF
# `.node-version` can defeat the build's Node version detection outright.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
